        "created_at": "2017-08-22T16:22:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"schadkehnfreude\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/schadkehnfreude/48/2357_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> schadkehnfreude:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There won't be all that much to see from the video.We basically just asked some questions.And then we all died and that was the end of our story.<span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p><span>I don't know. Some of the facial expressions from Christopher, Adam, and Anthony were great!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> </span></p>\n<p><span>And watching Trevor \"push a button\" to start Anthony playing a song was pretty entertaining…&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> </span></p>",
